This project ports parts of Arm's Neural Super Sampling reference implementation
(https://github.com/arm/neural-graphics-model-gym, usecases/nss): the pass schedule, the offset
look-up table, and the pre- and post-processing. That code is licensed under the Apache License 2.0,
Copyright Arm Limited and/or its affiliates.

The NSS network weights in Sources/NSSMetal/Weights are Arm's, from
https://huggingface.co/Arm/neural-super-sampling, converted to another format (see that folder's
README). They are not covered by the Apache License: they're licensed under the Arm AI Model
Community License (included there), which governs their use and redistribution, including its
acceptable-use terms (Weights/ACCEPTABLE_USE.md).
